{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-phone-bridge",
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "description": "PocketPilot 的 DSH 插件：在侧栏底部加入「手机连接 / Phone link」入口，弹出配对二维码；界面文字跟随系统语言。装到电脑端 DSH，与手机 App 配套使用。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "pc/dsh-plugin-phone-bridge/lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./pc/dsh-plugin-phone-bridge/lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./pc/dsh-plugin-phone-bridge/lib/client.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./pc/dsh-plugin-phone-bridge/cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": [
        "./pc/dsh-plugin-phone-bridge/cordis.patch.yml"
      ]
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-renderer",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "4.0.2"
  },
  "files": [
    "pc/dsh-plugin-phone-bridge/lib",
    "pc/dsh-plugin-phone-bridge/cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "plugin",
    "phone",
    "remote"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/MengTan100/pocketpilot.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://mengtan100.github.io/pocketpilot/",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "_comment": "仓库根包：只为让 `dsh plugin add github:MengTan100/pocketpilot` 这类『填仓库地址安装』可用 —— 真正的插件源码在 pc/dsh-plugin-phone-bridge/，两个 package.json 的 dsh 字段必须保持一致。",
  "_watermark": {
    "project": "dsh-phone-bridge",
    "origin": "8db5189c93",
    "license": "MIT",
    "notice": "见 WATERMARK.md"
  }
}
